    <headline>Thunderstorm This Afternoon in Sumatera Utara</headline>
    <description>Thunderstorms and heavy rainfall are forecasted to occur starting from 24 September 2026, 13:55 WIB in parts of Sumatera Utara especially in: AFULU, ALASA, ALASA TALUMUZOI, AMANDRAYA, ANGKOLA BARAT, ANGKOLA SANGKUNUR, ANGKOLA SELATAN, ANGKOLA TIMUR, ARAMO, ARSE, BAHOROK, BATAHAN, BATANG ANGKOLA, BATANG NATAL, BATANG ONANG, BATANG SERANGAN, BATANG TORU, BORONADU, DOLOK SILAU, GALANG, GIDO, GOMO, GUNUNG MERIAH, GUNUNGSITOLI IDANOI, HAMPARAN PERAK, HIBALA, HILISALAWA'AHE, HURUNA, IDANOTAE, LABUHAN DELI, LAHEWA, LAHEWA TIMUR, LAHOMI, LAHUSA, LOLOFITU MOI, MA'U, MANDREHE, MANDREHE BARAT, MANDREHE UTARA, MARANCAR, MAZINO, MEDAN DELI, MORO'O, MUARA BATANG GADIS, NAMOHALU ESIWA, NATAL, ONOHAZUMBA, PADANGSIDIMPUAN ANGKOLA JULU, PADANGSIDIMPUAN BATUNADUA, PADANGSIDIMPUAN HUTAIMBARU, PADANGSIDIMPUAN SELATAN, PADANGSIDIMPUAN TENGGARA, PADANGSIDIMPUAN UTARA, PAGAR MERBAU, PAGARAN, PAHAE JAE, PAHAE JULU, PANGARIBUAN, PEGAJAHAN, PERBAUNGAN, PULAU-PULAU BATU, PULAU-PULAU BATU TIMUR, PULAU-PULAU BATU UTARA, PURBA, SAIPAR DOLOK HOLE, SAYUR MATINGGI, SERBA JADI, SIABU, SIATAS BARITA, SIBABANGUN, SIBORONG-BORONG, SIMANGUMBAN, SIPIROK, SIPOHOLON, SIROMBU, SOGAE'ADU, SOSOPAN, STM HULU, TANAH MASA, TANO TOMBANGAN ANGKOLA, TARUTUNG, TUGALA OYO, ULU IDANOTAE, ULU MORO'O, ULUNOYO, ULUSUSUA.
 These conditions may lead to reduced visibility, strong winds, and localized flooding.
 The public is strongly advised to remain vigilant during this period, limit outdoor activities, and take all necessary precautions to ensure safety.
 Conditions are expected to gradually improve by 24 September 2026, 16:55 WIB.</description>
